<title>FINLAND: NOKIA ADR FALLS TO $59 IN NEW YORK.</title>
<headline>NOKIA ADR FALLS TO $59 IN NEW YORK.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nokia Oy's A share ADR opened at $58-5/8 in New York on Friday -- up $0-3/8 -- but soon fell to $59, down $0-1/4 from Thursday's close.</p>
<p>The latter price corresponds to about 304.64 markka.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 240, news@reuters.fi</p>
</text>
